# Base URL for the Express API in ../api (see api/src/server.ts, port 3000).
# Expo inlines EXPO_PUBLIC_* variables at bundle time, so restart `npx expo start`
# after changing this.
#
#   web / iOS simulator   http://localhost:3000
#   Android emulator      http://10.0.2.2:3000
#   physical device       http://<your-computer-LAN-IP>:3000

# To get your computer's LAN IP, run `ifconfig` (macOS/Linux) or `ipconfig` (Windows) and look for the "inet" or "IPv4" address in the output.

EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://192.168.1.249:3000
